= Surprise and Modulators
== The surprise stream
Medulla publishes an efference copy (what was commanded). A phyz one-step forward
model per organ predicts the next input; the residual against what was sensed is
published as a typed, per-organ surprise stream. // TBD: not built.

== Modulators
Arousal (from surprise, threat, people), fatigue (battery, heat) and curiosity
(unknown floor, weak places) are latched scalar streams. Organs read them as inputs
and shift their own gains; they stay pure. // TBD: not built.
